{"data":{"attachmentkeynames":["rs"],"desc":"Internal shared patch-journal implementation. Source history is instance-local in the runtime library: an ordered ID index and one record per patch. Dual-read runtime or legacy source journals; migrate/append lazily converts, verifies every entry, then removes legacy history via app.delete. Supports read/status/append/migrate/move/delete; new records use unique_session_id. Serializes process-local journal writes. Callers should normally use list_control_patches or convert_patch_journals.","import":"use flowlang::datastore::DataStore;\nuse flowlang::flowlang::system::time::time;\nuse flowlang::flowlang::system::unique_session_id::unique_session_id;\nuse ndata::dataobject::DataObject;\nuse ndata::dataarray::DataArray;\nuse std::sync::{Mutex, MutexGuard, OnceLock};","params":[{"desc":"read, status, append, migrate, move, or delete","name":"op","type":"String"},{"desc":"Source library owning the control","name":"lib","type":"String"},{"desc":"Source control name or record id","name":"ctl","type":"String"},{"desc":"Target library for move; empty otherwise","name":"to_lib","type":"String"},{"desc":"Patch fields for append/move; empty object otherwise","name":"entry","type":"JSONObject"},{"desc":"Maximum newest-first patches for read; 0 returns all","name":"limit","type":"Integer"},{"desc":"For migrate: report without writing or deleting","name":"dry_run","type":"Boolean"},{"desc":"Calling session; used to authorize legacy/runtime record deletion","name":"nn_sessionid","type":"String"}],"returntype":"FLAT","type":"rust"},"id":"klvnjy1a1c17d9880h47","readers":[],"time":1794248573304,"username":"system","writers":[]}